The [[Steel Goobert]] is a neutral [[Pet]] normally obtained by combining a [[Goobert]] with a [[Hero Sword]]. Every few activations of the items on its sides, the [[Steel Goobert]] will permanently raise the damage of the [[weapon]]s above and below it, and gain some {{icon/block}}.

The [[Steel Goobert]], along with the [[Blood Goobert]] and [[Light Goobert]], are part of every "Rainbow" goobert craft.
